OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham to meet Irish
OL,4,ATaoiseach for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister Andy Burnham and
OL,7,FTaoiseach (Irish PM) Micheal Martin
OL,8,Fwill hold their first official meeting
OL,9,Fin Manchester on Friday.
OL,11,FMartin will be the first international
OL,12,Fleader to visit Number 10 North, the
OL,13,Fgovernment said ahead of the talks.
OL,15,FThe men are expected to discuss further
OL,16,Fstrengthening of the UK/Ireland
OL,17,Frelationship including boosting trade,
OL,18,Fsecurity and working with the EU.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
