OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham to meet Irish
OL,4,ATaoiseach for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said he was "delighted" to be
OL,7,Fhosting the taoiseach and said it was
OL,8,Fan "historic and proud day for
OL,9,FManchester".
